    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in the highly regarded Cypress Grove South estate, this impressive four-bed semi-detached family home presents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a residence in one of Templeogue's most established and sought-after neighbourhoods. Renowned for its mature tree-lined avenues, strong sense of community and outstanding family-friendly amenities, Templeogue continues to be a location of enduring appeal for generations of homeowners. Enjoying a peaceful setting within this quiet residential enclave, the property benefits from the convenience of nearby Templeogue Village, where an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and everyday services contribute to the area's welcoming village atmosphere. The combination of spacious accommodation, a prime location and exceptional amenities make this a home perfectly suited to modern family living.\n\nComplete with well-proportioned and generous accommodation throughout, the property offers a practical and versatile layout designed to meet the needs of a growing family. A welcoming porch opens to the entrance hall, setting the tone for the bright and inviting interiors beyond. To the front, the spacious living room provides an ideal setting for relaxation and entertaining, with generous natural light enhancing the sense of space. To the rear, the kitchen/dining room forms the heart of the home, offering an excellent environment for everyday family life, dining and social gatherings, while enjoying direct access to the rear garden. An attached garage and WC complete the ground floor accommodation, with the garage offering excellent storage and potential for future conversion, subject to the necessary planning permissions. Upstairs, four generously proportioned bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation for families of all sizes and are complemented by a well-appointed family shower room. The property further benefits from significant potential for extension and personalisation, allowing discerning purchasers the opportunity to create a home tailored to their own requirements.\n\nThe location is undoubtedly one of the property's greatest assets. Templeogue Village is within easy walking distance and serves as the focal point of this thriving community, offering a range of local businesses, cafés, restaurants and essential services. The area is particularly popular with families due to its exceptional choice of highly regarded schools, including St Pius X National School, Bishop Galvin National School, St Joseph's Boys' School, Our Lady's School and Templeogue College, together with a number of other well-established educational facilities nearby. Recreational opportunities are at a premium, with Bushy Park and Tymon Park providing extensive green spaces, walking trails, playgrounds and sporting facilities, while numerous local clubs cater for a wide range of interests including GAA, rugby, soccer and tennis. Excellent public transport services provide regular access to Dublin City Centre, while the nearby M50 road network ensures seamless connectivity to all parts of the city and beyond. Combining generous accommodation, a mature residential setting and an enviable location close to every conceivable amenity, this is a superb family home in a neighbourhood that continues to rank among South Dublin's most desirable addresses."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.88m x 5.53m\n\n\nStorage - 1.88m x 1.55m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.66m x 6.21m\n\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 3.81m x 6.21m\n\n\nWC - \n\n\nGarage - 5.34m x 2.17m\n\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 2.85m x 4.48m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.05m x 3.66m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.81m x 3.48m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.83m x 2.62m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.66m x 2.44m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.46m x 1.63m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Excellent 4 bed family home set in the enviable Cypress Grove South estate</li><li> Beautiful, most generous rear garden, an ideal space for entertaining friends/family</li><li> Superb potential to further extend/convert (subject to relevant p.p.)</li><li> Most sought-after family orientated estate</li><li> Off-street parking</li><li> GFCH with recent boiler</li><li> Modern double glazing throughout and modern front door</li><li> Sought-after family orientated location</li><li> A number of excellent Dublin bus routes service the area</li><li> Easy access to the M50 road network, connecting to all major national routes</li><li> Close to an array of excellent schools, sports and recreation, shops and villages</li><li> Bushy Park & Tymon Park and all their wonderful facilities are on its doorstep.</ul>"
      },
